rations (Booxi, Transperfect, reCAPTCHA, GDPR cartridge, Optimizely, Crazy Egg) get register pages added, or is the repo sufficient for those?\n* [ ] Confirm whether `projectState.md`'s status tracker should be expanded to cover all 28 (currently missing 10) as a separate repo-side fix.\n\n---\n\n*Compiled 2026-07-07 by cross-referencing* `.claude/docs/architecture.md`*,* `.claude/docs/memory/projectState.md`*,* `.claude/docs/design/openItems.md`*, and this Confluence section's 9 Integration Register pages (Integration Overview, Product, PDP, Checkout, Order History, Order Details, My Account, Store Details, Inventory Sync) plus the MuleSoft Integration — Overview page. Last edited 2026-07-07: INT-033/Measmerize collision resolved.*",
